translate italian izzy1_86459c4f:

    # "Okay, I'm going to do it. I'm going to go talk to them."
    "Ok, lo farò. Andrò a parlare con loro."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:15
translate italian izzy1_f33a08f7:

    # "I swallow my fear and walk casually up towards the people standing around the picnic tables."
    "Ingo la paura e mi avvicino con disinvoltura alle persone in piedi intorno ai tavoli da picnic."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:18
translate italian izzy1_e6ebfaea:

    # "As soon as I begin to approach, they stop what they're doing and turn towards me."
    "Non appena comincio ad avvicinarmi, smettono di fare quello che stavano facendo e si girano verso di me."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:19
translate italian izzy1_7899e502:

    # "They look intimidating, but I don't stop. I keep walking until I'm standing just a few yards away from them."
    "Sembrano minacciosi, ma non mi fermo. Continuo a camminare finché non mi trovo a pochi metri da loro."

