translate italian izzy1_d20e163b:

    # gl "Where you going, twig-boy?"
    gl "Dove stai andando, ragazzino-ramoscello?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:25
translate italian izzy1_7d2401c7:

    # pc "Twig-boy?"
    pc "Ragazzino-ramoscello?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:27
translate italian izzy1_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice 'voices/izzy_1_2.mp3'
    voice 'voices/izzy_1_2.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:28
translate italian izzy1_d093d218:

    # gl "Yeah, cause you about the size of a twig and my guys could snap you in two."
    gl "Sì, perché sei grande più o meno come un ramoscello e i miei ragazzi potrebbero spezzarti in due."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:29
translate italian izzy1_aec5c4f7:

    # "I look over at them behind her. I almost believe that they could."
    "Guardo verso di loro, dietro di lei. Quasi credo che potrebbero farlo."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:30
translate italian izzy1_51076f5a:

    # pc "I just thought I'd come over and say hi. I'm new in town."
    pc "Pensavo solo di passare a salutare. Sono nuovo in città."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:32
translate italian izzy1_d41d8cd9_2:

    # voice 'voices/izzy_1_3.mp3'
    voice 'voices/izzy_1_3.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:33
translate italian izzy1_f9a04499:

    # gl "And you think we're the welcoming committee? We look like the type that'd invite you over, make you a casserole?"
    gl "E pensi che siamo il comitato di benvenuto? Sembriamo il tipo di persone che ti inviterebbero a casa e ti preparerebbero uno sformato?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:35
translate italian izzy1_23081509:

    # moose "Haha! A casserole! You so funny, Izzy."
    moose "Ah ah! Uno sformato! Sei proprio divertente, Izzy."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:37
translate italian izzy1_d41d8cd9_3:

    # voice 'voices/izzy_1_4.mp3'
    voice 'voices/izzy_1_4.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:38
translate italian izzy1_c2c19747:

    # gl "Shut the fuck up, Moose."
    gl "Chiudi quella cazzo di bocca, Moose."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:39
translate italian izzy1_33e887bb:

    # moose "Sorry, girl. My bad."
    moose "Scusa, ragazza. Colpa mia."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:42
translate italian izzy1_d41d8cd9_4:

    # voice 'voices/izzy_1_5.mp3'
    voice 'voices/izzy_1_5.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:43
translate italian izzy1_f6a69cf1:

    # gl "Anyways, we ain't no city council and we ain't an open forum."
    gl "Comunque, non siamo né il consiglio comunale né un forum aperto."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:45
translate italian izzy1_d41d8cd9_5:

    # voice 'voices/izzy_1_6.mp3'
    voice 'voices/izzy_1_6.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:46
translate italian izzy1_671e7cca:

    # gl "So you ain't welcome here. Get it, Twig?"
    gl "Quindi qui non sei il benvenuto. Capito, Twig?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:51
translate italian izzytwigtalk_bc94c85f:

    # gl "You back, Twig?"
    gl "Sei tornato, Twig?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:52
translate italian izzytwigtalk_5e16b4dd:

    # gl "I told you that you ain't welcome here."
    gl "Ti ho detto che qui non sei il benvenuto."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:56
translate italian izzytwigtalk_19da926c:

    # gl "Good. Get the fuck out of here, Twig."
    gl "Bene. Vattene via da qui, Twig."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:59
translate italian izzytwigtalk_03a3489c:

    # "I turn and walk away. After I take a few steps I can hear them all laughing. It's humiliating."
    "Mi volto e me ne vado. Dopo aver fatto qualche passo, li sento ridere tutti. È umiliante."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:60
translate italian izzytwigtalk_6aa25614:

    # "Maybe I'll try again some other time, but for now I just want to get out of here."
    "Magari ci riproverò un’altra volta, ma per ora voglio solo andarmene da qui."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:70
translate italian izzytwigtalk_ea29e717:

    # gl "Oh, is that what you think?"
    gl "Oh, è questo che pensi?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:71
translate italian izzytwigtalk_4f1631c8:

    # gl "Fine. Moose, grab him."
    gl "Va bene. Moose, prendilo."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:72
translate italian izzytwigtalk_c7045d3c:

    # moose "You got it, girl."
    moose "Ci penso io, ragazza."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:75
translate italian izzytwigtalk_bfacd7f0:

    # "With unnatural speed for his size, the big man charges towards me, arms out."
    "Con una velocità innaturale per la sua stazza, il gigante mi si lancia contro a braccia aperte."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:77
translate italian izzytwigtalk_d623de1c:

    # "Without even thinking about it, I turn and run the other way."
    "Senza nemmeno pensarci, mi giro e scappo nella direzione opposta."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:78
translate italian izzytwigtalk_c857d906:

    # "He gives chase for a bit, but then gives up and goes back to the others."
    "Mi insegue per un po’, ma poi rinuncia e torna dagli altri."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:81
translate italian izzytwigtalk_2a2c5fa4:

    # "I don't stop though. I just showed how much of a pussy I am by running there and now I can't just go back and face them again."
    "Io però non mi fermo. Ho appena dimostrato quanto sono un codardo scappando e ora non posso semplicemente tornare indietro e affrontarli di nuovo."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:82
translate italian izzytwigtalk_224c9c2b:

    # gl "That's right, keep running, Twig!"
    gl "Esatto, continua a correre, Twig!"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:83
translate italian izzytwigtalk_67906573:

    # "She yells after me, taunting me as I head back towards my car."
    "Mi urla dietro, prendendomi in giro mentre torno verso la mia auto."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:84
translate italian izzytwigtalk_45a42840:

    # "Maybe if I was more confident, I could stand my ground, but for now I just want to get out of here."
    "Forse se fossi più sicuro di me, potrei tener loro testa, ma per ora voglio solo andarmene da qui."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy1.rpy:85
translate italian izzytwigtalk_9a4f14d6:

    # "I could probably boost my confidence by chatting up random strangers at the school café. That seems like the most obvious way."
    "Probabilmente potrei aumentare la mia sicurezza chiacchierando con sconosciuti a caso alla caffetteria della scuola. Sembra il modo più ovvio."

